  "title": "Morel Mushroom Soup",
  "description": "Hearty, homemade morel mushroom soup is delicious and easy to make on the stovetop with fresh morels, onion, garlic, and herbs simmered in moscato wine, broth, milk, and cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Elizabeth Brockman"
  ],
